   \:30c6\:30f3\:30d7\:30ec\:30fc\:30c8\:30d7\:30ec\:30fc\:30b9\:30db\:30eb\:30c0:
     `content`      \[LongDash] \:30c1\:30e3\:30f3\:30af\:306e Content \:3092\:6587\:5b57\:5217\:5316
